          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "comprehension",
          "title": "Reading",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "दूध, दही अर छाछ दुकान रोज दिनूगै ६ सूं १० तांई (tā̃ī) खुली है। आथण दुकान ५ सूं ८ तांई (tā̃ī) खुली है। रविवार दुकान दिनूगै ६ सूं १२ तांई (tā̃ī) खुली है। दोपार अर रात दुकान बंद (band) है। सोमवार दुकान बंद (band) है। भाव: दूध ५४। आज घी कोनी। दही घणो आछो है! आभार।."
            },
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "READ",
              "instruction": "the notice once, straight through, without translating",
              "spoken": false,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU READ: the notice once, straight through, without translating]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "READ",
              "instruction": "it a second time, and find every line that says when",
              "spoken": false,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU READ: it a second time, and find every line that says *when*]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Most lines open on a when: रोज, आथण, रविवार, दोपार, सोमवार. Each stretch of hours runs सूं … तांई (tā̃ī). भाव is the price, written in digits. The line with! is an advert, set into the notice to bring you in."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": true,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s each]"
